          <mxGeometry x="1040" y="520" width="210" height="36" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>

        <mxCell id="303" value="✓ 1 cold start shared across all routes&lt;br&gt;✓ 1 warm instance pool&lt;br&gt;✓ 1 Secrets Manager fetch on cold start&lt;br&gt;✓ Simpler ops (one function to deploy)&lt;br&gt;✓ ~$5/mo at 100K requests" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#EEF7ED;strokeColor=#82b366;fontSize=11;align=left;spacingLeft=8;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="830" y="566" width="190" height="115" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="304" value="✗ 3 cold start pools to keep warm&lt;br&gt;✗ 3× provisioned concurrency cost&lt;br&gt;✗ 3× Secrets Manager calls&lt;br&gt;✗ More IAM roles, more deployments&lt;br&gt;✗ Negligible savings on compute" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FDECEA;strokeColor=#f8cecc;fontSize=11;align=left;spacingLeft=8;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1040" y="566" width="210" height="115" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>

        <!-- ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
             OPTIMIZATION TIPS
        ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ -->

        <mxCell id="400" value="Cost Optimization" style="text;html=1;fontStyle=1;fontSize=14;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="600" width="300" height="30" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>

        <mxCell id="401" value="1  Reduce Lambda memory 1024 MB → 512 MB — app is I/O-bound (LLM latency dominates). Halves compute cost with no measurable latency impact." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;fontSize=11;align=left;spacingLeft=8;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="640" width="730" height="44" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>

        <mxCell id="402" value="2  Remove PrivateLink (Secrets Manager Interface endpoint) at low traffic — replace with Gateway endpoint (free) or cache secrets in Parameter Store. Saves ~$15/mo fixed." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;fontSize=11;align=left;spacingLeft=8;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="694" width="730" height="44" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>

        <mxCell id="403" value="3  Add Provisioned Concurrency (2 instances) instead of splitting Lambdas — eliminates cold starts for ~$7/mo extra, cheaper than managing separate functions." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;fontSize=11;align=left;spacingLeft=8;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="748" width="730" height="44" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>

        <mxCell id="404" value="4  At &gt;1M req/mo — evaluate migrating inference to ECS Fargate. Fargate pricing is per vCPU/memory-hour, cheaper than Lambda at sustained high concurrency." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;fontSize=11;align=left;spacingLeft=8;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="802" width="730" height="44" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>

        <mxCell id="405" value="5  LLM cost is 75%+ of the bill — optimise token usage (prompt caching, shorter system prompts, smaller models for non-sensitive queries) before tuning infrastructure." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;fontSize=11;fontStyle=1;align=left;spacingLeft=8;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="856" width="730" height="44" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>

      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
  </diagram>

